  i) Static methods only can access only static static data
     It cannot access a non static data i.e instance data
     
------->>>>Example---------     
     
     Class StaticDemo{
     static void display(){
          System.out.println("Hello");
          
          }
     
     
     
  ii) Static method can call only  other static method 
     and cannot call a non static method.
     
------->>>>Example---------     
     
     Class StaticDemo{
     static void display(){
          System.out.println("Hello");  //here non static method show() cannot be referred from static context
          }
     void show(){                     
          System.out.println("2");
      }

}























